          <figcaption>Switch without backing out.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Offline -->
    <article class="wrap beat split split-pair" aria-labelledby="offline-title">
      <div class="beat-text">
        <h3 id="offline-title" class="beat-title">No acting on stale data</h3>
        <div class="prose-narrow">
          <p>When you’re unlocking accounts and resetting MFA, out-of-date information is worse than none. If the app loses its connection, it says so and offers a shortcut to Settings. If the admin cancels, a blocking screen keeps them from acting on data the app can’t refresh.</p>
          <p>While content loads, skeleton screens hold its shape, so nothing jumps around when the real numbers arrive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pair">
        <figure class="phone">
          <Image src={offline} alt="A Could Not Connect alert over a user profile: Make sure you are connected to Wi-Fi or your cellular network, with Go to Settings and Cancel." widths={[360, 540, 750]} sizes="(min-width: 900px) 280px, 76vw" />
          <figcaption>No connection, no guessing.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="phone">
